                </a>
                <h3>	Product Sets & Insert Boxes	</h3>
                <p>
		Build as solution around products that must arrive together, stay separated or be selected in sequence. Foam, paperboard, kraft, cardboard and corrugated inserts can be die-cut or divided around relevant product shapes and components.	</p>
                <ul>
                                                            <li>
		Kits, sets or component packs	</li>
                                        <li>
		Foam, trays or partitions	</li>
                                        <li>
		Coordinated exterior and interior	</li>
                                        <li>
		Selection, lift-out or setup	</li>
                                    </ul>
                <p>
		A fitted arrangement makes the contents feel deliberate and easier to understand from the first opening.	</p>
                <a href="
